  Description: "LEAF is an automated testing framework for AR developers that helps validate Lens behavior. It enables developers to define repeatable test scenarios, simulate interactions, and catch regressions caused by Lens changes, UI updates, or platform evolution. The result is faster debugging, less manual device testing, and more reliable releases."
